            <ArticleTitle>Structure elucidation and NMR assignments of a new triterpenoid from Ixeris chinensis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1551-1554</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1080/14786419.2017.1283496</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A new triterpenoid, namely 3β-hydroxy-13β,28-epoxyolean-11-enyl trans-caffeate (1), was isolated from the EtOAc extract from Ixeris chinensis Nakai. The structures of 1 were elucidated by spectroscopic methods, including UV, IR, HR-ESI-MS and extensive 1D and 2D NMR techniques.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
